#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:5
#: fe04635d225e41abafd0cdb851575a68
msgid "Telemetry Forwarding"
msgstr "数传转发"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:7
#: 3f4e28cc7a404fdf935cbeb8c61424d0
msgid ""
"A key feature of MAVProxy is its ability to forward the messages from your "
"UAV over the network via UDP to multiple other ground station software on "
"other devices. For example: you can run a ground station on a laptop next to"
" your antenna and forward via wifi to a smartphone/tablet which lets you "
"easily relocate to launch into wind before heading back to your fixed "
"antenna. You can also use it to send telemetry data to a friend acting as "
"spotter several kilometers away (via 4G vpn) during a longer flight so that "
"he could monitor the entire flight and determine where to look to find the "
"aircraft in flight."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 的一项关键功能是能够通过 UDP "
"将无人机的消息转发到网络上的多个其他地面站软件设备。例如：您可以在天线旁的笔记本电脑上运行地面站，并通过 Wi-Fi "
"转发到智能手机或平板电脑，以便在返回固定天线前轻松移动到逆风起飞位置。您还可以通过 4G VPN "
"将数传数据发送给数千米外担任观察员的朋友，让其在较长的飞行过程中全程监控并确定飞行器在空中的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:21
#: e1e25ca6b9014e08a242c4f139e5e205
msgid ""
"To forward the MAVLink data over the network including to a local program on"
" your PC you simply need to add some extra parameters when starting MAVProxy"
" via the command line."
msgstr "若要通过网络转发 MAVLink 数据（包括发送到本机上的本地程序），只需在通过命令行启动 MAVProxy 时添加一些额外参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:26
#: 857ac0d9d3e446c7bfa7fa93f6580b82
msgid "Local Forwarding"
msgstr "本地转发"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:28
#: c47c0212f15644398e53851af0b3a5fd
msgid ""
"To connect with a local ground station software (such as Mission Planner or "
"QGC) start MAVProxy under Linux with the command:"
msgstr "若要连接本地地面站软件（如 Mission Planner 或 QGC），请在 Linux 下使用以下命令启动 MAVProxy："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:35
#: 4c94f067f9ef46c8a1be92dfd5ef0472
msgid "an abbreviated version also works:"
msgstr "缩写形式同样有效："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:41
#: ab3373604797426da2ce0658e5391604
msgid "since MAVProxy will auto-connect to the autopilot on the Linux PC."
msgstr "因为 MAVProxy 会自动连接到 Linux 主机上的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:43
#: 275fe7fced814269bf4ce4620b575bc3
msgid "For a Windows PC, start a command prompt and enter:"
msgstr "在 Windows 电脑上，打开命令提示符并输入："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:49
#: e43a83ca2ccb4a57adc60eb134726065
msgid "where COMx is the com port to which the autopilot is attached."
msgstr "其中 COMx 是飞控所连接的 COM 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:51
#: d3dcf17f3ae34b1b84210f44684002ed
msgid ""
"Then open the ground station software and select a UDP connection on port "
"14550. It should then connect to your UAV."
msgstr "然后打开地面站软件，选择端口 14550 上的 UDP 连接，即可连接到无人机。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:55
#: f033f16e6f244db09db3d1211b59423f
msgid "Forwarding to Remotes"
msgstr "转发至远端"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:57
#: 47a0832e054f4372bf10c13b85676ea2
msgid ""
"While MAVProxy also has the capability of forwarding using TCP, it is not "
"recommended, since network delays can cause long lags if joystick control is"
" being used."
msgstr "虽然 MAVProxy 也支持通过 TCP 进行转发，但不推荐使用，因为在使用 `joystick` 控制时，网络延迟可能导致较长的延时。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:59
#: 722690f970654b088142d9cd4a2ab027
msgid ""
"Finally, you can add the IP address of any computer to forward the telemetry"
" stream onwards to other ground stations."
msgstr "最后，您可以添加任意计算机的 IP 地址，以将数传流继续转发到其他地面站。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:62
#: bd438e4ecd1f4977a89e311f7126baf1
msgid ""
"On the local network/wifi you will need to ensure there is no firewall on "
"the client PC stopping the incoming stream to your ground station software."
msgstr "在本地网络或 Wi-Fi 上，需要确保客户端电脑上没有防火墙阻止传入流到达地面站软件。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:65
#: 49fa9e5bbd8c4dabb3f9dd6601e064d2
msgid ""
"Add - -out *destination IP address*:14550 to the end of the MAVProxy "
"command. You can add as many separate - -out parameters as you want "
"depending on how many extra ground stations you are running."
msgstr ""
"在 MAVProxy 命令末尾添加 --out *目标IP地址*:14550。您可以根据所运行的额外地面站数量，添加任意数量的 --out 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/forwarding.rst:68
#: d68dc788fa7a4bd59067c408726d7f73
msgid ""
"Set each ground station to listen for UDP packets on port 14550 and, again, "
"make sure its firewall is not blocking incoming traffic on UDP port 14550."
msgstr "将每个地面站设置为在端口 14550 上监听 UDP 数据包，并同样确保其防火墙未阻止 UDP 端口 14550 的入站流量。"
